{"id":"n40101-2-6","stage":1,"title":"노랗다 · 发黄","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40101-2-6-1","ko":"너 얼굴빛이 왜 그렇게 노랗니?","zh":"你的脸色怎么那么黄？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼굴빛이","meaning":"脸色，面色，神色，气色","explanation":"얼굴빛：脸色，面色，神色，气色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴빛","audio":"/audio/79d7081d422ebe1e38ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67301","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노랗니?","meaning":"发黄，蜡黄","explanation":"노랗다：发黄，蜡黄；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"노랗다","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40101","senseId":"2","lemma":"노랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79d7081d422ebe1e","term":"얼굴빛","zh":"脸色，面色，神色，气色","audio":"/audio/79d7081d422ebe1e38ae.mp3","entryId":"67301","definition":"流露于脸上的表情、情绪或身体状况。","pronunciation":["얼굴삗"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"c4c95c7fd5963a0f","term":"노랗다","zh":"发黄，蜡黄","audio":"/audio/c4c95c7fd5963a0fffee.mp3","entryId":"40101","definition":"由于营养不良及患病等原因，脸上没有血色，呈黄色。","pronunciation":["노ː라타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f084e04a903112899ff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40101-2-6-2","ko":"몸이 안 좋은가 봐.","zh":"我身体大概不太舒服。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은가","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；은가：引出疑问或推测的内容，常与 보다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/99f14cdb4b35a7eb834e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40101","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1851,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你的脸色怎么那么黄？","我身体大概不太舒服。","刚才有位自称是你姑姑的人打过电话来。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的脸色怎么那么黄？","我身体大概不太舒服。","刚才有位自称是你姑姑的人打过电话来。"],"answer":1}]}
